<title>USA: Italian Oven gets DIP financing.</title>
<headline>Italian Oven gets DIP financing.</headline>
<dateline>LATROBE, Pa. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Oven Inc said it has obtained debtor-in-possession financing from a private lender in the form of a $200,000 revolving line of credit.</p>
<p>The credit facility will expire in 90 days, unless a transaction for the sale of the company or a plan of reorganization is sooner approved by bankruptcy court. The court has approved the credit facility and proceeds of the line of credit have been made available, it said.</p>
</text>
